span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/464360/extras/978301201cc6c5f4d105eacf542f829f.avif?t=1759534478\" width=480 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Matt Griffiths &amp; Mic N</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Design by Max Dohme </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Published by Crunchy Leaf Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
